Third-party components (not included in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------

Face detection and recognition use InsightFace (https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface)
and its "buffalo_l" model pack (SCRFD detector, ArcFace recognizer). The model files are
downloaded separately by InsightFace on first use and are NOT distributed with this project.
InsightFace publishes its pretrained models for non-commercial research use; check the
current terms in the InsightFace repository before any other use.

Runtime libraries installed from PyPI keep their own licences: NumPy, SciPy, Pillow,
cryptography, onnxruntime, InsightFace and tomli.

The generated site loads the Antonio, Karla and IBM Plex Mono typefaces from Google Fonts
(SIL Open Font License 1.1).
